      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 3268352227,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "In general, wouldn't it be possible to have the code be conditional only based on the presence of functions in the API, which also sometimes differ by version as the flavors adopted functions introduced by the other?\n\nAt least the new FreeBSD has finally moved off of Heimdal.",
