        {
          "id": 3268451990,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "It might be, but I haven't looked into it that closely.\n\nAlthough FreeBSD used Heimdal for its system Kerberos, it's had MIT Kerberos in ports for a long time, so even there I'm not sure how often Wireshark has been built with Heimdal.",
